前必需目标：4 项（按原顺序完整保留）\n\n1. \"LOCAL_MATERIAL_PREPARATION\"：当前约定本地产物已核验 / LOCAL_OUTPUT_VERIFIED\n未满足/阻塞原因：原结果未列阻塞；仍以当前状态为准\n下一步：原结果未要求下一步\n原核验 d474bbc8-0124-48bb-a602-0f52a83279fa / v2：对应本次当前结果\n\n2. \"LOCAL_CASE_RESOURCE_ASSOCIATION\"：当前约定本地产物已核验 / LOCAL_OUTPUT_VERIFIED\n未满足/阻塞原因：原结果未列阻塞；仍以当前状态为准\n下一步：原结果未要求下一步\n原核验 57f88ee1-fcfe-4eed-96b3-37a060005a71 / v3：对应本次当前结果\n\n3. \"LOCAL_INTERNAL_ACCEPTANCE\"：当前约定本地产物已核验 / LOCAL_OUTPUT_VERIFIED\n未满足/阻塞原因：原结果未列阻塞；仍以当前状态为准\n下一步：原结果未要求下一步\n原核验 35956ba7-33f5-4a8a-b8db-21fc85ff84e8 / v4：对应本次当前结果\n\n4. \"LOCAL_SYNTHETIC_RECEIPT_ACKNOWLEDGEMENT\"：当前约定本地产物已核验 / LOCAL_OUTPUT_VERIFIED\n未满足/阻塞原因：原结果未列阻塞；仍以当前状态为准\n下一步：原结果未要求下一步\n原核验 8db8a1ed-1248-4ce4-8e31-fd06ee7624d1 / v5：对应本次当前结果\n\n资格：NOT_EVALUATED；外部受理：NOT_SUBMITTED；线下履约：NO_EVIDENCE；Case目标未完成。\n原采用来源和旧计划只作为历史引用；当前所有目标均在上方保留。\n原行/原来源指纹引用原接口完整投影；导出的白名单子对象不用于重算这些原指纹。下方整包核对数据指纹可按JSON规范化重算。\n核对数据 SHA256：f909cdd4128968f582ebd1115d8bc67df8da478706098bb4a9cdc51175b802dc\n核对数据（UTF-8 JSON，原文按JSON转义；不包含读取凭据）：\n{\n  \"actor_id\": \"fixture-a\",\n  \"preparation_id\": \"3754df4a-eae8-485e-bd05-28ae0fac02bb\",\n  \"case_id\": \"d9f14a63-8730-49fe-8c7c-4e72e1ca82bb\",\n  \"run_id\": \"a0ea8826-407f-4d3f-bf49-fc0f273ef0dd\",\n  \"preparation_revision\": 8,\n  \"request_revision\": 6,\n  \"current_request\": \"SYNTHETIC current ordinary outputs\",\n  \"original_request\": \"PRIVATE_REQUEST_A\",\n  \"plan_id\": \"0bc828ae-b621-4aa3-8a66-4a89eb5abe91\",\n  \"plan_revision\": 5,\n  \"state\": \"LOCAL_OUTPUTS_VERIFIED\",\n  \"read_only\": true,\n  \"automatically_verified\": false,\n  \"case_goal_completed\": false,\n  \"qualification\": \"NOT_EVALUATED\",\n  \"external_acceptance\": \"NOT_SUBMITTED\",\n  \"offline_fulfillment\": \"NO_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"scope\": \"SYNTHETIC_CASE_RECORD_PACK_V1\",\n  \"source_scope\": \"SYNTHETIC_ADOPTED_LOCAL_GOAL_RESULTS_ONLY\",\n  \"current_required_goals\": [\n    \"LOCAL_MATERIAL_PREPARATION\",\n    \"LOCAL_CASE_RESOURCE_ASSOCIATION\",\n    \"LOCAL_INTERNAL_ACCEPTANCE